# Expo / RN native projects are generated via `expo prebuild`.
#
# The two native-project ignores are anchored with a leading slash on purpose:
# an unanchored `ios/` matches a directory of that name at *any* depth, which
# silently swallowed every Swift file of the local Expo module under
# `modules/*/ios/` — the module compiled and shipped on the device while its
# source was never committed. Only the generated projects at this level are
# derived; a module's own native source is not.
node_modules/
.gems/
.expo/
dist/
/ios/
/android/
*.log
.DS_Store
